  "ruleText": "Env-A 1606.04 EPA Notification. Within 5 working days of granting a request to use non-conforming fuel, the department shall notify the EPA of such approval.\n\nSource. #10415, eff 9-24-13 (formerly Env-A 1609.04); ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
